# phyml's model struct and everything below it, allocated once per run when
# --tstv estimates kappa.  Free_Model() touches structures Free_Tree_Lk has
# already released, so it cannot be called here.  About 3.4 kB, --tstv only.
#
# This covers any leak under treeML(), so a new one there would go unnoticed.
# Only Memcheck:Leak is suppressed; memory errors still fail.
{
   phyml_allocations_under_treeML
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: definite,indirect
   fun:calloc
   fun:mCalloc
   ...
   fun:treeML
}
